      "description": "The visual entity 'woman_holding_goat' is mapped onto the textual entity 'goat_stereotype'. The meme uses the image of the woman affectionately holding a goat to visually represent the derogatory metaphor of Muslims being 'goats', implying they are primitive or animalistic. This mapping is central to the meme's hateful intent, as it equates the visual subject with the offensive stereotype.",
